            {
              "option_id": "e2_opt_free",
              "label": "Place a coin inside and set it outside",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Setting it outside with payment!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n08_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "e2_opt_vip",
              "label": "Stitch the red charm back into the lining",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": "Sealing the charm back inside!",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n08_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You lay the coat neatly outside your threshold and whisper your farewell. The wool slumps flat and motionless.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "SECRET UNLOCKED: The room warms instantly. A soft voice sighs \"Thank you for returning my warmth\" before fading with the jasmine scent.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n09_merge",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "3:00 AM passes in total silence. You open the front door to check—the black coat is completely gone.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n10",
          "type": "incoming_call",
          "caller_id": "ally",
          "caller_label": "Mina (Vintage Shop)",
          "ringtone_sfx": "call_ring",
          "ring_duration_ms": 12000,
          "can_decline": true,
          "on_answer_node_id": "e2_n11_ans",
          "on_decline_node_id": "e2_n11_dec"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_ans",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Mina gasps: \"Avery, I’m opening my shop camera—the black coat is hanging back on my rack, dripping wet!\"",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n12"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_dec",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You decline and check your closet. Hanging safely among your clothes is a single dry jasmine flower.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n12"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n12",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "No Refunds After Midnight",
          "teaser_text": "Season Finale · Next time you buy vintage, always check the inside lining first.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "ambient": "suspense",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
