        {
          "id": "e4_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "ally",
          "text": "My grandma couldn’t find Clara’s body after the ’96 storm, so she bound Clara’s warmth inside the red charm to keep her from freezing!",
          "timestamp_label": "2:40 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e4_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e4_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "So when I pulled out the red charm, I didn’t unleash a curse—I made her cold again?!",
          "timestamp_label": "2:41 AM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e4_n04"
